# SharedArrayBuffer is only available on a cross-origin isolated page, and the
# tracker needs it: OpenCV is built with -pthread, so the WASM memory is
# shared, and frames are handed to the worker through a SharedArrayBuffer.
#
# require-corp additionally demands Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy on every
# subresource — including the emscripten pthread worker — so it is set here too.
#
# Format understood by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
